papers:Investors a core:Dataset ;
    core:relatesTo core:FinanceAndInsurance ;
    dc:source "" ;
    rdfs:comment "provided by PPDai. It consists of almost 10,000 registered investors, and each of which is classified as investing over $73,000. The attributes are the user’s basic information (e.g., age, gender, residential place, house price) and behavior (e.g., frequency of use of the app, etc.)" .

papers:KKBOX a core:Dataset ;
